# Schedule definition for thorn OpenCLRunTime

SCHEDULE OpenCLRunTime_Setup AT basegrid
{
  LANG: C
} "Set up OpenCL device"

SCHEDULE OpenCLRunTime_Analyse AT analysis
{
  LANG: C
} "Copy OpenCL memory buffers back to host memory"

SCHEDULE OpenCLRunTime_Terminate AT terminate
{
  LANG: C
} "Output profiling information"
